# The text_structure package's manifest (format: packages/README.md).
package text_structure
version 0.1.0
summary the structure of a text, for edits by address: Unicode's sentence boundaries (UAX #29, Unicode 18.0, all 512 lines of its conformance test) with CLDR's English suppressions, a tree of sections, paragraphs and sentences for plain text, Markdown and HTML (through the PatLang DOM, each unit linked to its node), addresses, a walk, edits by address through file_marshal, and a tree carried past edits re-reading only what they touched (docs/plans/text-structure.md, steps 1 to 5)
entry update.patlang
include structure.patlang
include sentences.patlang
include sentence_table.patlang
include plain.patlang
include markdown.patlang
include html.patlang
include update.patlang
